So it doesn't mean three out of four people support banning superintelligence,
but it shows how much resistance these projects are now facing.

133
00:14:11,246 --> 00:14:19,072
人们真的很担心电费、水资源消耗，以及他们的社区到底能从这笔交易中得到什么。
People are genuinely concerned about electricity bills, about water usage, about what their community actually gets out of the deal.

134
00:14:19,312 --> 00:14:24,900
