We started with evidence that AI development is accelerating and that AI itself is increasingly contributing to that acceleration.

148
00:15:37,312 --> 00:15:40,352
但这些模型仍然运行在物理基础设施上。
But those models still run on physical infrastructure.

149
00:15:40,526 --> 00:15:44,272
