Even if the technology keeps improving, and even if people like Musk are thinking about just moving to space,
politics will still have an effect on how fast this build out continues, whether we like it or not.

151
00:15:56,686 --> 00:16:01,348
就我个人而言，我当然希望我们刚刚谈到的科学进步能够继续下去。
Personally, I want to see the scientific progress we just talked about continue, of course.

152
00:16:01,582 --> 00:16:09,284
