最终会造福他们和家人这样的承诺之外，还想要更多的保障。
But I also understand why someone looking at a higher electricity bill wants more
than a promise that all this will eventually benefit them and their families.

153
00:16:09,614 --> 00:16:14,116
如果由我来决定，我绝对不会放慢数据中心的建设。
If it were up to me, I would definitely not slow down the build-out of data centers.

154
00:16:14,352 --> 00:16:23,712
但我肯定会强迫 AI 公司承担成本并与社区共享财
富，或者干脆把它们建在更好的地方，比如加拿大。
But I would certainly force the AI companies to cover the costs and share the wealth with the community,
and perhaps just build them in better areas, like Canada.

155
00:16:23,950 --> 00:16:25,988
